{"id":"nf2b7ms6cajsrr84rlk7zmx9k","title":"光模块三巨头股价反弹逻辑与行业壁垒解析","originalTitle":"光模块，开启大反攻？","summary":"A股光模块三巨头近期股价反弹，中际旭创、新易盛、东山精密三季度营收同比分别增长171.8%、61%、超400%。文章解析了认证周期（1-2年）、代际切换（800G→1.6T→3.2T）及物料锁单（EML芯片缺口超30%）形成的经营壁垒，并基于高盛预测（2026-2028年全球市场规模677亿至1485亿美元）论证业绩高增长持续性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"钛媒体"},"links":{"original":"https://www.tmtpost.com/8202010.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T03:22:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T03:41:08.755Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T03:41:08.755Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["财报"],"score":75,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"市值观察","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}